    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUDOVERA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Audovera was the first wife of a king, from whom he had five children."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0393-b57e59f62da2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FREDEGONDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fredegonde was a consort of a king, of lower birth and also considered his 'evil spirit'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0393-b57e59f62da2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GALSWINTHA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Galswintha was the older half-sister of Brunhilde of Austrasia and married to a king."</data>
